# Backend requirements

- Use Rust (preferably with the Actix‑web framework) to create a lightweight, efficient RESTful API.
- Include CRUD endpoints for managing exercise entries.
- Use SQLite as the database to store exercise data.
- Do not hardcode any addresses, use variables instead and put them in the [server.env](mdc:server/server.env) file
